# RiskPath environment configuration
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Mock backend toggle — ONLY for Lovable preview / offline demos.
# When unset or "false", the app talks to the real backend at VITE_API_BASE_URL.
# When "true", every API call is served from src/lib/mockApi.ts and the
# model identifier is suffixed "-MOCK" so the mode is obvious at a glance.
# VITE_USE_MOCK_API=true
